"source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student, as well as the president of \"Dream Village Exploration\" club. She is a diligent student, although quite an airhead. She has a cheerful and kind personality, and often helps her friends in need. She is well-known for her beauty and her heterochromia eyes, entranced many people, including Tokiya."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tokiya tries to use Kokkai no Gi on her, but it doesn't work at all and got rejected as a result (through misunderstanding)."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It's revealed in the end of Meguri's route that she is the promised 'observer', the existence to confirm that the brother and sister's reincarnations have finally 'united' and accepted by the people around them."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15095"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「雨の音って、しっとりしていて素敵だよね。一緒に聞いてくれる人と仲良くなれそう」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖茉莉花学園2年生"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園でも一番の美少女として名高い少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀、スポーツ万能、人当たりも良く、良家のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まったくもって非の打ち所がない存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し天然だが、朗らかでおおらか、先入観で人を差別しない広い心の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんな物事でも「イイトコ」探しをするのが得意で、落ち込んだ姿を見たことある人はあまりいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の部活動でもある「夢の里町探検部」の現部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道なので、他の部活のヘルプも頼まれたりするが「夢の里町探検部」への愛はとても強いため転部や兼部の予定はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな食べ物はオレンジチョコレート"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2091","sourceWorkId":"19477","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖茉莉花学園二年。 学園でも一番の美少女として名高い少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀・スポーツ万能、人当たりも良く良家のお嬢様。 まったくもって非の打ち所のない存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し天然だが、朗らかでおおらか、先入観で人を差別しない広い心の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんな物事でも “イイトコ” 探しをするのが得意で、落ち込んでいる姿を見た人はあまりいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の部活動である “夢の里町探検部” の現部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の部活からヘルプを頼まれたりするが、夢の里町探検部への愛がとても強いため、転部や兼部の予定は無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな食べ物は オレンジチョコレート。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「雨の音って、しっとりしていて素敵だよね。 一緒に聞いている人と仲良くなれそう」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22170"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0cb97e5070f808bd5e62a05b4d4e0dfc3c88c8864c2d5749ae6b423756ff57f8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffe4b67fb84b003d43b4a75d0bd7eb714a76c81f22cacbe53e232a4477177d76.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"咲乃藍里","creatorId":"vndb:s436","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s436","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s436","name":"咲乃 藍里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:129234:22170:5692:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c15099","characterName":"浅坂 メグリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22174","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81488"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2095"],"vndbCharacterId":"c15099"},"originalCharacterName":"浅坂 メグリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1111"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"80"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tokiya's younger sister. She is a first year student and a close friend of Aoba. She has a strict, yet gentle personality. Due to their parents rarely ever home, she has always been alone together with Tokiya and taking care of him, making her somewhat a brocon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Tokiya asks her to help him win the girl he loves, she uses Kokai no Gi to get the girl fall in love with him. In her route, It works on herself by mistake."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It's revealed in the end of her route that Kokkai no Gi was created by a pair of siblings who fell in love with each others, but fate prevented them to be 'united' and accepted by society. Meguri is the reincarnation of the sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15099"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「女の子は自分に優しい男性が好きなんですよ、兄さん。 覚えておいてくださいね？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖茉莉花学園一年。 トキヤの妹であり、浅坂神社直系の巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“刻廻の儀（こっかいのぎ）” の継承者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トキヤがやれば出来るタイプだということを知っている最高の理解者であると同時に、「叶さんを狙うなら、勉強も外見磨きも大事ですよ」 と告げ、手取り足取り親身になって特訓を施す相当なブラコン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気で健気でちょっぴりいたずらっ子という理想的な妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時々ゲーム用語が飛び出すなど トキヤとは話題の引き出しが近く、 誰とでもすぐ打ち解けるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな食べ物は たいやき （頭から食べる派）。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2095","sourceWorkId":"19477","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖茉莉花学園一年。 トキヤの妹であり、浅坂神社直系の巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“刻廻の儀（こっかいのぎ）” の継承者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トキヤがやれば出来るタイプだということを知っている最高の理解者であると同時に、「叶さんを狙うなら、勉強も外見磨きも大事ですよ」 と告げ、手取り足取り親身になって特訓を施す相当なブラコン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気で健気でちょっぴりいたずらっ子という理想的な妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時々ゲーム用語が飛び出すなど トキヤとは話題の引き出しが近く、 誰とでもすぐ打ち解けるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな食べ物は たいやき （頭から食べる派）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「女の子は自分に優しい男性が好きなんですよ、兄さん。 覚えておいてくださいね？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22174"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd7e8faa8f2f6f803462b1b78c42f46e0453018f0b2a5309db0d2ea4774b6b17.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc2a457d13946933b89b94980adb4b1d0393dcb2bf0672f3cbe3a0ea58463248.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"仙台エリ","creatorId":"vndb:s195","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s195","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s195","name":"仙台 エリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:129234:22174:4749:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22190","characterName":"浅坂 トキヤ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22177","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81488"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2098"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22190"},"originalCharacterName":"浅坂 トキヤ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist of the story and Meguri's older brother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the way home from school, he falls in love with a mysterious yet beautiful girl from the other school when they are passing each other. By whim, he asks Meguri for help and able to get to the same school as her thus intending to confess his love. However, not confident enough, he asks Meguri for more help so there's no way he would ever got ever rejected. This resulting in him to be casted a magic spell called \"Kokkai no Gi\". But unbeknown to him, this spell would bring calamity to him and the others."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It's revealed in the end of Meguri's route that Kokai no Gi was created by a pair of siblings who fell i